          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/rn154dd5329#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded low on the figures of the date: the figures could give another date. '357' and '3. 4.' are plain. What I read as the year '11.' is two tall strokes with entry ticks and could instead be an initial 'M.' belonging to the name, in which case the inscription gives no year at all. The surname is not certainly legible; 'Mohr' is my best reading."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
